  "description": "The SparseCollections library provides the SparseArray<T> and SparseMatrix<T> collection classes. The array class allow statements such as \"array[1000000] = 5\" or \"array[-1000000] = 6\" without having to create a large array. The matrix class does the same thing using a two-dimensional-array metaphor.",
